": ["claude-sonnet-5-5"], "effort_requested": "high", "cost_estimate_usd": 0.0238042, "assistant_note": "Documented data support a chylothorax: milky fluid, triglycerides 434 mg/dL, and lymphocyte-predominant exudate. Next I will record the working differential and plan a workup for the cause.", "temperature_accepted": false, "seed_accepted": false, "max_output_tokens_accepted": false}}
